<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1 TI Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso ya Pauli kwa Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso ya Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ya mwanduso ya Timoteo tsayandikighwa na Pauli kwa mwanang'ina wake, Timoteo. Ibaluwa ino tsayandikighwa mna ghumwaka ka ghwa sitini na mbili mbaka sitini na nne kulawa Yesu hakalile muisi. Aghano tsaghakala matsuwa gha ukutsigha gha ughima wa Pauli. Pauli na Timoteo tsawahabehi ghendo mbaka Pauli tsakamkema Timoteo mwanaghe. Filp 2:22, 1 Tim 1:2, 1:18.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aino ibaluwa imwe mna tsibaluwa nne tsawandikilighwe imunu yumwe yumwe, na si kanisa bae. Tsibaluwa tsingi ndatu tsawandikilighwe iwanu tsitso tsino, Timoteo wa keli, Tito na Filimoni. Ibaluwa ya mwanduso ya Timoteo ina malaghitso mengi gha likanisa 2:1-15, ipfilongotsi we likanisa pfawobamighwa kuwa 3:1-13 na ukuwakanya iwalangulitsi waghutsu 1:3-11, 4:1-5, 6:2-5. Chinu chino cholangusa Pauli pfang'ali yomlangulitsa Timoteo pfobamighwa kuwa mne likanisa. Ibaluwa ya mwanduso ya Timoteo ina malaghitso mengi ighodaha kuwapfila ipfilongotsi wa makanisa mna ghamatsuwa ghetu kutsitenda ghoya sang'ano tsa makanisa ghawo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-2 Pauli kakwandusa kumlamsa Timoteo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:3-11 Pauli komkanya Timoteo yalangitse na iwalangulitsi waghutsu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:12-19 Pauli koghendelela kulonga pfolangusa mighede kuna Yesu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 2-3 Pauli komlongela Timoteo mbuli ya kumtambikila Imulungu na pfilongotsi wa ghamakanisa.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 4-6 Pauli komalitsila ibaluwa yake kwa kumlongela Timoteo mbuli tsa ukumalitsila.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Nene Pauli, mtumighwa wa Kiristu Yesu kwa laghitso lye Imulungu Mkombotsi wetu na Kiristu Yesu lolelo lyetu.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Nokwandikila Timoteo imwanangu ghendoghendo mne inoghola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Nokulombela kwa Aba wetu Imulungu na Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu yamtendeleni uluso na yamwikeni tseghamba.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli tsa walangulitsi waghutsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Ka pfanikulongele haning'ali nighenda Makedoniya, nobama ukale ako Efeso ili uwaghome iwanu wangi waleke kulangulitsa ghamalangulitso ghe ughutsu, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />walongele watsileke simo tsila itsilihela chinu na mbuli tsa ghamataghwa ghe lukolo yang'aghomala bae, agho ghotenda iwanu wesonge, wala ng'aghoitsenga sang'ano ye Imulungu mna ukutoghola. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Chinu chikulu cha laghitso lino iwo unoghelo, iulawa mne ghumoyo ghunoghile, na ukusaghula ukuteda ghanoghile, na inoghola ya kweli. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Iwanu wangi wagha kulawa mna ghano na wahundukila midawalo ya ubotsi. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Wobama wawe iwalangulitsa ghamalaghitso gha Musa lekeni ng'awomanya bae wolonga choni au ipfinu pfawakomangitsa.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Twomanya ka ghamalaghitso ghanogha ka ghotumika ghoya. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Pfipfila twomanya ghamalaghitso ng'aghekighwe bae kwaajili ye iwanu iwanoghile, ila ghekighwa kwaajili ya iwanu ing'awokinda ghamalaghitso na iwolema kutegheletsa utawala na iwanu iwombetsa Imulungu na wane nzambi na ing'awahenzeluke na iwanu iwalihela idini na iwanu iwokoma aba tsawo na mai tsawo na iwokoma wanu, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />na waghoni, wamale iwowasa na wamale wayawo, iwakwiba iwanu, iwaghutsu na iwolapfa ukalangama wa ughutsu au iwotenda chinu chochose ing'achighenda hamwe ne ghamalangulitso gha ughima. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Ghamalangulitso agho ghamne Imbuli Inoghile ye Imulungu iyane ukulu na iyotunyighwa imbuli yaning'ighwe niwapetele iwanu.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uluso we Imulungu kwa Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Nolonga mighede kwa Kiristu Yesu Imtwatsa wetu, iyangaile ingupfu, kwaapfila kambona nene namwenyepfale, kanisaghula nimsang'anile, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />hata ka aho mwanduso ning'ali nimligha yeye na kuwadununza iwanu na tsanikala mghobo, lekeni Imulungu kambonela libatsi kwaapfila tsanitenda apfo kwa ubotsi wangu wanikalile nawo na kwaapfila tsanahela inoghola. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Lekeni Imtwatsa wetu tsakangaya uluso wake bwelele, kangaya inoghola na unoghelo mne ukwilunga na Kiristu Yesu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Imbuli ino yolongesa, na inogha kutogholighwa, Kiristu Yesu katsa muisi kuwakombola wane nzambi. Na nene nina nzambi kubita wose, <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />lekeni Imulungu kambonela libatsi, ili Kiristu Yesu alanguse ukududumila kwake kwose kuna nene yanine nzambi kubita wose, kanenda niwe chitango kwa awala iwatsomtoghola, na kubokela ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Lelo Imndewa wa ghamatsuwa ghose, yang'akufa, yang'akoneka, Imulungu yaliheka, yeye apfukighwe na atunyighwe ghamatsuwa ghose. Ona.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Mwanangu Timoteo, nokulaghitsa laghitso lino, kwa ghamalonga ghe unabii ghaulongelighwe ghumwande ughawinze ili udahe kuhuma pfinoghile ing'ondo ya kuyamila Imbuli Inoghile, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />uikinde inoghola, na kubama kusaghula kutenda ghanoghile. Iwanu wangi waghalema agha, apfo waihinya inoghola yawo. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Mna wawo hana tsina Hemenayo na Alekisanda, awo nimwing'a Setani ili walangulitsighwe waleke kumligha Imulungu.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso gha kutamanila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Tanu ghendo, nobama mumlongele Imulungu chambama, mumlombe Imulungu, muwalombele iwanu wangi, na mumlongele mighede Imulungu kwaajili ye iwanu wose. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Tuwalombele iwandewa na wose wane uwetso, ili tukale ghoya na kwa tindiwalo na kutenda ghanoghile na kumpfuka Imulungu. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Agha ghanogha na ghomnoghela Imulungu Mkombotsi wetu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />iyobama iwanu wose wakombolighwe na wamanye kweli. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Kwaapfila kuna Imulungu yumwe na kuna yumwe iyowalamlitsa iwanu ne Imulungu, imunu ayo iyo Kiristu Yesu, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />iyelapfile imwenyegho kuwaghombola iwanu wose. Ughombola awo woneka mne ichipindi chake. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Na kwa chinu acho nisaghulighwa niwe mtumighwa na niwapetele iwanu imbuli inoghile na niwe mlangulitsi mne inoghola na mne ukweli kwe iwanu si Wayahudi bae. Nolongesa, sighutsuka bae!<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Lelo chila hanu nobama iwamale iwotenda ghanoghile kwe Imulungu wenule ghamoko ghawo walombe, bila kuwa na maya wala kwihisanya. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Pfipfila nobama iwapinga wapfale kwa mahala, na pfinoghile, na si kwa kusuka tsimvili tsa ukugholija wala kwa nzahabu na lulu, wala kwa ghamaghwanda gha bei ng'ulu, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />ila wawe na ghamatendo ghanoghile ka pfaibamighwa kwa iwapinga iwolonga wompfuka Imulungu.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Iwapinga welangulitse mbuli tse Imulungu kwa kunyamala tulu aku wotegheletsa ghendo. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Nene simleka ipinga amlangulitse au amtawale mmale, iwapinga wanyamale. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Kwaapfila Adamu tsakalongola kulumbighwa, kuya Eva. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Wala si Adamu bae iyaghutsukighwe, ila ipinga iyo iyaghutsukighwe na kuwa na nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Lekeni iwapinga watsokombolighwa mne ukweleka iwana, ka woghendelela mne inoghola, mne unoghelo na mne uhenzeluka na kukala pfinoghile.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Pfilongotsi mne kanisa pfawobamighwa kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Mbuli ino yolongesa, imunu ang'abama isang'ano ye kulongotsa kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu, ayo kobama isang'ano inoghile. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Lelo mlongotsa kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu aleke kuwa na ghamatotso, awe mmale yane mwehe yumwe na adahe kuwa na chiyasi na inzewele na iyoulikitsighwa, na iyowabokela iwahenza na amanye ukulangulitsa, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />aleke ukupatika, aleke kuwa mghobo ila ahole, aleke kuwa mkali wala mnoghela tsisendi. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Alongotse ghoya kaye yake na awatende iwanaghe wamuhulikitse bila ukumbetsa. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Mana ka imunu ng'odaha bae kulongotsa ghoya ing'anda yake, apfi yodahatse kulilolesa kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Kuya aleke kuwa mkiristu wa sambisambi, hela katseghoda na ukuhighighwa ka pfahighighwe Yehile <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Kobamighwa aghwe imunu iyanoghile kwe iwanu iwali kunze mwe kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu ili aleke kughwila mchinyala na mne mtegho wa Yehile.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wapfitsi mne kanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Iwapfitsi we kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu pfipfila wobamighwa wawe iwanu iwotegheletsighwa na iwolongesa, waleke ukupatika au kwipatila tsisendi kwa nzila tsihile. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Wobamighwa waikinde kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile kweli ye inoghola iighubulighwe ne Imulungu. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Tanu wobamighwa waghetsighwe, wang'oneka wahela totso, muwaleke wawe iwapfitsi we kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Wehe tsawo pfipfila wobamighwa wawe iwotegheletsighwa, waleke kuwa watsongeletsi, wawe ne chiyasi na iwotogholighwa mna ghose. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Mwapfitsi mne kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu awe na mwehe yumwe yaliheka, naye yadahe kuwalongotsa ghoya iwanaghe ne ing'anda yake. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Mana iwapfitsi iwotenda isang'ano yawo pfinoghile wakoneka ne iwanu wanogha, na wodaha ukulonga mbuli tse inoghola yawo mne Kiristu Yesu bila ukupfuka.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukweli iughubulighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Nokwandikila ghano aku nololela ukutsa kuna ghweghwe matsuwa chidogho ighakutsa. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Lekeni ka nokawa, aghano ghanikwandikile ghakutende umanye iwanu pfawobamighwa kuwa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, alyo kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu iyali mghima, ingutso na lukwalambatsa lwa kweli. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Ukweli iughubulighwe we inoghola yetu mkulu ghendo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">Yeye tsakoneka mne lumbo lye imunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">tsakalangusighwa ne Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu ka kanogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">tsakoneka ne wamalaika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">tsakapetighwa mghati mwe iwanu we isi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">tsakatogholighwa muisi mwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">tsakasolighwa kuchanya kulanga kune utunitso.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Iwalangulitsi we ughutsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kolonga mwatsimwatsi ka ghamatsuwa gha utsighilo iwanu wangi watsoileka inoghola na kutsiwinza muwe tse ughutsu ne ipfinu ipfilangulitsighwa ne ipfinyamkela. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Ghamalangulitso agho ghakutsa kubitila iwanu waghutsu, awo imimoyo yawo iwa misughu. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Watsowaghoma iwanu waleke kukwela, waleke ukuja ipfijo pfimwenga, ipfijo pfalumbile Imulungu pfibokelighwe kwa kulonga mighede ne awala wane inoghola iwomanya kweli. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Kwaapfila ipfinu pfose pfayalumbile Imulungu pfinogha, na kuduhu ichinu che kulemighwa, ila pfose pfibokelighwe kwa kulonga mighede, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />kwaapfila imbuli ye Imulungu ne ukulomba, yopfitenda pfitogholighwe ne Imulungu.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumwa yanoghile wa Kiristu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ung'awalongela iwandughu wose ghamalaghitso ghano kutsakuwa mwapfitsi yunoghile wa Kiristu Yesu, na yukulile mne mbuli tse inoghola, na aghala ghamalangulitso ghuwinzile. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Lekeni utsileme simo tsila itsili si tsa dini bae na itsilihela mana. Wilangulitse kukala ka pfobama Imulungu. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Kutenda ghamatsowetsi ghe ulukuli kunogha, ila ukutenda pfila pfoyobama Imulungu kunogha kwa ipfinu pfose, kwaapfila ghotwing'a laghano lye ughima wa sambi na ye ughima iukutsa.<verse eid="1TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Mbuli ino yolongesa na ya kubokelighwa na ya ukutogholighwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Apfo twoghaya na ukusang'ana ng'ani, kwaapfila twomlolela Imulungu iyali mghima, iyo Mkombotsi we iwanu wose, ghendoghendo awala iwomtoghola.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Uwalaghitse na uwalangulitse ipfinu pfino. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Uleke kutoghola imunu wowose akubetse kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa msongolo, ila uwe imunu we kwighighwa ne iwanu iwotoghola, mna ukulonga na pfaukala na mna inoghola na mna unoghelo na mna uhenzeluka. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Usang'ane ghendo kuwasomela iwanu Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka na uwalangulitse na uwapetele mbaka hanikutsa. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Uleke kuleka kutumila gholelo lya Muhe Mwenzeluka ilili mghati mwako, lwing'ighwe kubitila unabii na ahala iwabala hawakwikile ghamoko.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Walangule ghendo agho ghose na ughatende, ili chila imunu yone pfaughendelela ukukula. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Wilolese ghweghwe ghumwenyegho na ghamalangulitso ghako. Ughendelele kutenda apfo, kwaapfila ung'atenda apfo kwitsekombola ghumwenyegho na iwanu iwokuhulikitsa.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Ukukala ne Wakiristo wangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Uleke kumkembela mnzee, ila ulonge naye ka aba wako. Iwasongolo nawo ulonge nawo ka ndughu tsako, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />iwapinga wanzee ulonge nawo ka mai tsako, ne iwali ulonge nawo ka lumbu tsako, mne uhenzeluka wose.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Uwatendele pfinoghile pfitsuka iwali pfitsuka ghendo. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Lekeni ka chitsuka kana iwana au watsukulu, welangulitse tanu kughatenda ghawobamighwa kutenda kwa kuwalolesa iwanu wa kaye tsawo iwenyegho, na kwa kutenda apfo wowaliha iwabala wawo na welesi wawo. Kwaapfila kutenda apfo komnoghelesa Imulungu. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Ipinga yali chitsuka ghendo, ayula iyalekighwe yaliyeka, ayo kamwikila Imulungu lolelo lyake, na koghendelela kumlomba Imulungu ichilo ne imisi yamwapfile. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Lekeni chitsuka yang'oleka dong'o tsake, ayo kafa mmoyo hata ka kamghima. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Pfipfila uweng'e ghamalaghitso ghano ili iwanu wangi waleke kona ghamatotso kuna wawo. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Lekeni ka imunu ng'owalela bae ndughu tsake, ghendoghendo awala wa mng'anda mwake, imunu ayo koilema inoghola, na keha kubita imunu ing'ayotoghola.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Uleke kumwika chitsuka wowose mne kingili lye pfitsuka ka ng'apfikile bae imiyaka sitini. Kuya aghwe ipinga iyakwelighwe mala imwe, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />na iyamanyike kwa ghamatendo ghake ghanoghile ka yawalelile ghoya iwanaghe na kuwabokela iwahenza, na kuwopfugha ghamaghulu iwaenzeluka na kuwapfila awala iwaghanzike, na kwilapfa imwenyegho kutenda aghala ghose ighanoghile. <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Lekeni uleke kuweka pfitsuka wadodo mna kingili alyo, mana dong'o tsawo tsing'awatenda wabame kukwelighwa keli, watsomleka Kiristu. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Apfo watsakuwa na ghamatotso kwa kuleka laghano lyawo lya mwanduso. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Pfitsuka ka wano wakwandusa kuwa wadebwe na ukwangakwanga kulawa ing'anda imwe mbaka ing'anda ingi, kuya si wadebwe hela, ila pfipfila wasongeletsi na wakwingila mne mbuli tse iwanu wangi, aku wolonga ghala ng'awobamighwa kughalonga. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Apfo nobama pfitsuka awala si wanzee bae wakwelighwe, wapate iwana, na walolese kaye tsawo ili waleke kuwatenda wanebe wetu walonge mbuli tsetu pfihile. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Kwaapfila pfitsuka wangi ma waghaluka womuwinza Setani.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Lekeni ka ipinga iyomtoghola Kiristu kana pfitsuka mkaye mwake, leka yawapfile. Aleke kulilekela mtsigho kingili lye iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu, ili wanu awo iwomtoghola Kiristu wawapfile pfitsuka awala iwalihela chinu ghendo.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Iwabala iwolongotsa pfinoghile wobamighwa walihighwe mala mbili, ghendoghendo awala iwosang'ana kuwapetela iwanu na kuwalangulitsa. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Kwaapfila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga, “Uleke kumwoha ing'ombe chibang'wa haumtumila kupfuna.” na “Mtenda isang'ano kobamighwa yeng'ighwe maliho ghake.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Uleke kutoghola ghamaghomba kwe iwabala mbaka ghaghalighwe ne iwakalangama weli au wadatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Awala iwoghendelela kutenda nzambi muwakembele hambele he iwanu, ili iwanu wangi wapfuke. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Nokulaghitsa hambele he Imulungu na hambele ha Kiristu Yesu, na hambele he wamalaika iwasaghulighwe, uleke kuhigha kwa kusumka, kuya uleke kutenda mbuli yoyose kwa kulola chihanga che imunu. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Uleke kusumka kumwikila ghamoko imunu wowose yawe chilongotsi. Uleke kwingila mne nzambi tse iwanu wangi. Wilolese ghumwenyegho uwe mwenzeluka.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Uleke kunwa ghamatsi ghaliheka, unwe dipfai chidogho kwaajili ye lida lyako na utamu wako wa chila mala.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Nzambi tse iwanu wangi tsakoneka mwatsi, hata ka ng'ana wahighwe, iwanu wangi nzambi tsawo ng'atsikoneka mbaka ahala hawotsohighighwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Pfipfila ghamatendo ghanoghile ghakoneka mwatsi na hata aghala ing'aghokoneka, ng'aghodaha bae kwipfisa.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Iwatumwa wose wobamighwa kuwategheletsa iwatwatsa wawo ili iwanu waleke kuliligha taghwa lye Imulungu na kughabetsa ghamalangulitso ghetu. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Iwatumwa wane iwatwatsa Wakiristu waleke kuwabetsa kwaapfila wowona wawo ka Wakiristu weyawo hela. Ila wobamighwa wawasang'anile pfinoghile ghendo, kwaapfila awo iwobweda kulawa mne isang'ano yawo, wana inoghola na wonoghelighwa nawo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Ghamalangulitso ghe ughutsu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Uwalangulitse na uwakanye pfinu pfino. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Imunu wowose iyolangulitsa ipfinu pfingi, na yang'otoghola mbuli tsa kweli tse Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu no ukukala ka pfayobama Imulungu, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />ayo keghoda na ng'omanya imbuli yoyose bae, ila kana utamu wa kughutsaghutsa mbuli, na kwihisanya mbuli itsighala chepfu, ughobo, ghamaligho na ukwalangula wanu pfihile, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />na ukuhisanya kulihela utsighilo ikulawila kwe iwanu wane tsimbutsi itsihinyike, na iwalihela kweli. Wawo wopfikitsa ukumsang'anila Imulungu inzila ye kupata tsisendi.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Lekeni ukutenda ighomnoghela Imulungu no ukwenela, apfo pfipfo ipfinu ipfitwapfila ghendo. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Kwaapfila muisi amu ng'atutsile na chinu bae, kuya ng'atutsosola ichinu bae, <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />ila ka tuna ichijo na ghamaghwanda, twenele ne ipfinu pfatwinapfo. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Lekeni awala iwobama kuwa na tsimali watsakughwila mne ghamaghetso na mne chonzo cha usulukilo wa chibotsi, nawo wowaghala mna ukuhinyika na ukukomighwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Kwaapfila ukunoghela ng'ani tsisendi iwo mwanduso wa ghehile ghose. Iwanu wangi wasulukila ng'ani tsisendi mbaka waileka kutali inoghola, na waihoma imimoyo yawo kwa usungu mwingi kwa aghala ghawotenda.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malangulitsi kwa Timoteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Lekeni ghweghwe, imunu we Imulungu, kala kutali nagho. Ubame ukukala pfinoghile, ukale ka pfobama Imulungu, uwe ne inoghola, uwe na unoghelo, ududumile na uwe mwenyepfale. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Utowe pfinoghile ng'ondo ye inoghola, ukinde ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose iukemelighwe ne Imulungu hala haulongile kutoghola hambele he iwakalangama wengi. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Nokulaghitsa hambele he Imulungu iyopfing'a ughima pfinu pfose, na hambele ha Kiristu Yesu, iyalongese hambele ha Pontiyo Pilato, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />ughakinde ghamalaghitso ghano bila ghamatotso mbaka hayatsolawila Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Kulawila kwake kutsakuwa mne chipindi chinoghile ichikighwe ne Imulungu yatunyighwe na iyali mtawala aliheka, yeye ka Imndewa we iwandewa ne Imtwatsa we iwatwatsa, <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />yeye yaliheka yang'akufa bae, kamne ghumwanga ing'audahika kupfikighwa ne imunu. Kuduhu imunu iyamwonile wala iyodaha kumwona. Kuna yeye uwe utunitso ne ingupfu ya ghamatsuwa ghose. Ona! <verse eid="1TI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Walaghitse matajiri wa ughima ghuno wa sambi waleke kwighoda, kuya waleke kuhuwila utajiri ing'audaha kuhuwilighwa, ila wamuhuwile Imulungu, iyotwing'a ghose kwa uluso ili tughadeng'elele. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Walaghitse watende ghanoghile, watende mbuli nyingi tsinoghile, na wawe waluso na weyandae kuweng'a iwanu wangi ipfinu pfawo, <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />kwa kutenda apfo, itsowapfila kupata ughima wa kweli mne ichipindi ichikutsa, nawo watsokuwa ka iwanu iweikila pfinu pfingi ipfitsowapfila hambele. <verse eid="1TI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Ghweghwe Timoteo, ughalolese aghala ghwing'ighwe. Wibaghule ne mbuli itsili si tsa Imulungu bae na itsilihela mana na mahisanyo ghe elimu ya ughutsu. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Kwaapfila iwanu wangi waitoghola elimu ayo, na kwa kutenda apfo waghisa inoghola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Uluso we Imulungu ukale namwe.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>